<title>POLAND: Petrobank Q3 net falls to PLN 1.8 mln.</title>
<headline>Petrobank Q3 net falls to PLN 1.8 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Petrobank SA results for the third quarter ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>					    Q3 1996	Q3 1995</p>
<p>    operating profit		     2.58    vs   2.03</p>
<p>    net					1.76    vs   3.36</p>
<p>    pre-tax				  2.59    vs   2.03</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name is Petrobank SA.</p>
<p>    revenues from securities	   0.00    vs   0.01</p>
<p>    revenues from commission	   1.08    vs   0.45</p>
<p>    interest and similar revenues   16.48    vs  13.42</p>
<p>    interest and similar costs	 8.90    vs   6.48</p>
<p>    costs of commission		  0.08    vs   0.04</p>
<p>    income tax			     0.83    vs   1.33 refund</p>
<p>    other taxes			    0.00    vs   0.00</p>
<p>    extraordinary			  0.00    vs   0.00</p>
<p>JANUARY - SEPTEMBER</p>
<p>    operating profit		     8.65    vs  10.80</p>
<p>    net					5.35    vs   9.44</p>
<p>    pre-tax				  8.65    vs  10.80</p>
<p>    revenues from securities	   0.00    vs   0.01</p>
<p>    revenues from commission	   3.10    vs   1.46</p>
